title: exec->start does not surface the exit status
updated: 2026-08-24T03:31:49Z
---

The exit code of an exec instance comes from GET /exec/{id}/json (ExitCode), exposed here as exec->inspect, never from the start call. Nothing in the POD says so, so a caller reasonably assumes start returns the result. Either document the two-call sequence on exec->start or give it a convenience that fetches the status.
